<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2011/08/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>reagent</id>
    <version>0.2.0</version>
    <title>ReAgent</title>
    <authors>Partha Pratim Gogoi</authors>
    <owners>rugbedbugg</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent/blob/main/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rugbedbugg/ReAgent@7efd8e4189b13c62d5688962a84b4537a6954a7c/assets/icon.png</iconUrl>
    <description>ReAgent plans retrosynthetic routes for a target molecule and scores
each candidate on seven independent objectives: feasibility, precursor
availability, cost, safety, sustainability, efficiency, and how much of the
molecule a route builds rather than buys.

Chemistry facts are computed deterministically with RDKit. The single-step
model and tree search come from AiZynthFinder; ReAgent adds the agentic
evaluation, multi-objective aggregation and adaptive weight-learning layers.

This package installs ReAgent into its own Python 3.11 virtualenv, because
RDKit, ONNX Runtime and AiZynthFinder do not support newer interpreters.

Two one-time steps are needed after install, and they are not automatic
because the first downloads roughly 760 MB:

    reagent-download-data %LOCALAPPDATA%\reagent
    reagent build-stock-cache

Then: reagent plan "CC(=O)Oc1ccccc1C(=O)O"

The agent layer is optional and needs either a local Ollama server (--local)
or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (--assess). Planning, features and evaluation run without
either.</description>
    <summary>Agentic retrosynthesis planner that scores routes on seven objectives with RDKit-grounded chemistry.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent/releases/tag/v0.2.0</releaseNotes>
    <tags>chemistry cheminformatics retrosynthesis rdkit molecules science cli python</tags>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent</projectSourceUrl>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent/tree/main/SUBMISSIONS/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent/blob/main/README.md</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/rugbedbugg/ReAgent/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="python311" version="3.11.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
